contentText:
Ye&#8217;s struggles for acceptance as a rapper are well documented in the early stages of his career. Dame Dash admitted he originally signed the artist formerly known as Kanye West to Roc-A-Fella for his prowess as a producer, but the Chicago native had much grander aspirations.

